# Build context exclusions for services/Dockerfile.
#
# The runtime image previously used `COPY . .` with only a partial ignore list,
# so tests/ (100 files) and the full documentation tree shipped to production.
#
# docs/ is deliberately NOT excluded: AGENTS.md and CLAUDE.md are symlinks into
# it, and dropping the target would leave dangling links in the image.

# VCS and local state
.git
.gitignore
.env
.env.*
node_modules
data
data.stale*
logs
coverage
remote-dist
build-info.json
*.log
*.bak

# Tests and fixtures - the largest unnecessary payload
tests

# Development and publishing material with no runtime role
.github
specs
.agent-spec
README.md
README.zh-CN.md
CHANGELOG.md
